{"messages":[{"content":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `modules` is a list of `{module_id:string,capabilities:[distinct_strings],priority:integer}` with distinct module IDs. `memory` maps strings to JSON scalar values (null, boolean, integer excluding boolean, or string). `protected` lists distinct keys already in memory. `requests` is an ordered list of `{request_id:string,needs:[distinct_strings],writes:[{key:string,value:JSON_scalar}]}` with distinct request IDs. A module is eligible exactly when its capabilities contain every need; an empty needs list admits every module. Choose the eligible module with smallest (priority,module_id), using ordinary string lexicographic order for the second component. If none is eligible, selected_module is null (abstention), no writes are attempted, and blocked_writes is empty. Otherwise execute the request's writes in order. Ignore each write whose key is protected and report its zero-based index in blocked_writes; all other writes replace or create that memory entry. Protection applies throughout the task, so protected values retain their initial values. Return exactly `{routes:[{request_id,selected_module:string_or_null,eligible_modules:[module_ids_sorted_lexicographically],blocked_writes:[integer_indices]}],memory:final_memory_map}` with routes in request order. Competence is explicitly declared in capabilities; this task does not infer or train module competence.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"modules\",\"modules\":[{\"module_id\":\"alpha\",\"capabilities\":[\"arithmetic\"],\"priority\":1},{\"module_id\":\"beta\",\"capabilities\":[\"arithmetic\",\"search\"],\"priority\":1},{\"module_id\":\"gamma\",\"capabilities\":[\"vision\"],\"priority\":0}],\"memory\":{\"seal\":1000,\"budget\":7,\"note\":null},\"protected\":[\"seal\",\"budget\"],\"requests\":[{\"request_id\":\"r0\",\"needs\":[\"arithmetic\"],\"writes\":[{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":\"overwrite\"},{\"key\":\"note\",\"value\":0},{\"key\":\"budget\",\"value\":100},{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":null}]},{\"request_id\":\"r1\",\"needs\":[\"ocean\"],\"writes\":[{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":\"overwrite\"},{\"key\":\"note\",\"value\":1},{\"key\":\"budget\",\"value\":101},{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":null}]},{\"request_id\":\"r2\",\"needs\":[],\"writes\":[{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":\"overwrite\"},{\"key\":\"note\",\"value\":2},{\"key\":\"budget\",\"value\":102},{\"key\":\"seal\",\"value\":null}]}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"memory\":{\"budget\":7,\"note\":2,\"seal\":1000},\"routes\":[{\"blocked_writes\":[0,2,3],\"eligible_modules\":[\"alpha\",\"beta\"],\"request_id\":\"r0\",\"selected_module\":\"alpha\"},{\"blocked_writes\":[],\"eligible_modules\":[],\"request_id\":\"r1\",\"selected_module\":null},{\"blocked_writes\":[0,2,3],\"eligible_modules\":[\"alpha\",\"beta\",\"gamma\"],\"request_id\":\"r2\",\"selected_module\":\"gamma\"}]}","role":"assistant"}]}
